    "text": "<blockquote><p>Solving all questions one by one we get,</p><p>(i)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;elements.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>P</mi></math></p><p>(ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>tan</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>tan</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;elements.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>P</mi></math></p><p>(iii)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;elements.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>(iv)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;elements.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is correct.</p></blockquote>"
